<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  The dynamics configuration of the KissAs3Dm application.

  Every value that is missing from here keeps the one the framework gives it in
  KissAs3FwDynamicsConfig.xml, or the default coded into the DynamicsConfig class.

  This file is embedded and applied by DynamicsConfigDemo, and the displaying styles
  of this application are described in that very class.

  The colors, the align and the blur of the default displaying style are left to the
  framework on purpose: that style displays the embedded mosaic tile of the framework
  and wears the colors taken from it, so overwriting any of those here would only make
  this application start in an appearance no displaying style of it describes.

  The appFontSize is left on zero on purpose: a zero font size is the marker of the
  calculated one, so this application starts with the size the framework takes from the
  dimensions of the stage and it follows every later size of that stage as well. Every
  displaying style of this application is a copy of the default one, so all of them
  start with that very automatic size.

  These are the starting values only, the user can change them later on the settings
  panel of the running application.
-->
<config name="DynamicsConfig">
  <value key="appFontSize">0</value>
  <value key="appLineThickness">1</value>
</config>
